1
00:00:24,280 --> 00:00:25,079
Su Juan,

2
00:00:26,440 --> 00:00:27,519
from this day forward,

3
00:00:28,559 --> 00:00:30,280
for richer, for poorer,

4
00:00:31,120 --> 00:00:32,600
in sickness and in health,

5
00:00:32,920 --> 00:00:34,600
for better, for worse,

6
00:00:35,399 --> 00:00:38,799
to love him, honor him, and protect him

7
00:00:39,679 --> 00:00:41,320
until the end of your days.

8
00:00:42,399 --> 00:00:43,479
Do you?

9
00:01:20,480 --> 00:01:21,200
President Sun.

10
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:25,079
We were halfway through our chat.

11
00:01:25,079 --> 00:01:26,480
Can we continue?

12
00:01:27,799 --> 00:01:28,879
Regarding your company's

13
00:01:28,879 --> 00:01:30,799
recent public opinion issues,

14
00:01:30,799 --> 00:01:32,599
our PR firm is very confident

15
00:01:32,599 --> 00:01:33,560
that we can handle them well.

16
00:01:34,040 --> 00:01:35,920
Including some of the previous allegations.

17
00:01:36,200 --> 00:01:37,879
We will focus our attention

18
00:01:37,879 --> 00:01:39,040
heavily on these matters.

19
00:01:39,359 --> 00:01:41,239
We'll make sure you have no worries.

20
00:01:45,079 --> 00:01:46,120
I'm free. Go ahead.

21
00:01:48,840 --> 00:01:50,319
Do the valuation all over again?

22
00:01:51,239 --> 00:01:52,560
They're just bluffing you.

23
00:01:53,879 --> 00:01:54,920
No, it can't wait until tomorrow.

24
00:01:54,920 --> 00:01:55,920
A decision has to be made today.

25
00:01:55,920 --> 00:01:56,879
Okay, that's it.

26
00:01:58,000 --> 00:01:59,719
President Sun, about our proposal...

27
00:02:02,640 --> 00:02:04,159
Notify all departments for me,

28
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:05,400
to gather in the meeting room.

29
00:02:05,400 --> 00:02:06,560
I'll be at the office in 15 minutes.

30
00:02:06,719 --> 00:02:07,359
That's all.

31
00:02:09,199 --> 00:02:10,639
You're still here... Sorry about that.

32
00:02:10,719 --> 00:02:12,039
I need to hurry back to the office

33
00:02:12,120 --> 00:02:13,039
to handle some things.

34
00:02:19,599 --> 00:02:21,960
How about we chat in my car?

35
00:02:22,240 --> 00:02:23,080
Sure, no problem.

36
00:02:24,719 --> 00:02:25,960
I looked into your company's

37
00:02:25,960 --> 00:02:27,560
past three years' public opinion data.

38
00:02:27,800 --> 00:02:29,319
Although it's mostly positive overall,

39
00:02:29,400 --> 00:02:30,919
there are still some hidden risks.

40
00:02:31,319 --> 00:02:33,000
Like the previous rights protection incident,

41
00:02:33,199 --> 00:02:35,159
and the allegations of illegal fundraising.

42
00:02:35,439 --> 00:02:36,520
Once our company takes over

43
00:02:36,520 --> 00:02:38,120
the follow-up PR work,

44
00:02:38,120 --> 00:02:39,120
we will pay special attention

45
00:02:39,120 --> 00:02:40,319
to these issues.

46
00:02:46,560 --> 00:02:48,639
President Sun, your hand...

47
00:02:54,360 --> 00:02:55,439
This work,

48
00:02:55,879 --> 00:02:57,639
other companies can do it too.

49
00:02:58,240 --> 00:02:59,479
You'd better think carefully.

50
00:02:59,919 --> 00:03:01,000
After today,

51
00:03:01,759 --> 00:03:03,080
you won't get this chance again.

52
00:03:17,080 --> 00:03:18,360
This proposal of yours

53
00:03:18,360 --> 00:03:19,960
isn't really that impressive.

54
00:04:17,319 --> 00:04:18,279
Hello, President Han.

55
00:04:20,040 --> 00:04:21,879
Yes, I'm heading back to the office now.

56
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:25,720
Okay.

57
00:04:26,360 --> 00:04:27,120
Got it.

58
00:04:36,040 --> 00:04:36,720
She's asleep.

59
00:04:39,360 --> 00:04:40,560
How are the test results?

60
00:04:42,519 --> 00:04:44,040
Still waiting on a few results,

61
00:04:44,240 --> 00:04:45,439
but it shouldn't be anything serious.

62
00:04:45,920 --> 00:04:46,480
Alright.

63
00:04:48,199 --> 00:04:49,160
I'll head out then.

64
00:04:50,439 --> 00:04:51,000
Su Juan.

65
00:04:54,959 --> 00:04:55,759
You haven't eaten, right?

66
00:04:56,519 --> 00:04:57,399
Let me buy you dinner.

67
00:04:57,639 --> 00:04:58,240
No, it's fine.

68
00:04:58,240 --> 00:04:58,839
No need to be so polite.

69
00:04:58,839 --> 00:05:00,240
Why be so formal with me?

70
00:05:00,240 --> 00:05:01,759
M-My mom is sleeping right now.

71
00:05:01,759 --> 00:05:02,480
No problem.

72
00:05:03,120 --> 00:05:04,600
You have to let me thank you.

73
00:05:07,639 --> 00:05:08,680
Let's go. Come on, let's go.

74
00:05:13,920 --> 00:05:15,279
At my age,

75
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:17,560
we all have parents and kids to support.

76
00:05:18,439 --> 00:05:19,240
But I'm alright.

77
00:05:19,519 --> 00:05:20,600
I don't have kids.

78
00:05:21,680 --> 00:05:23,759
Sure, I have plenty of friends.

79
00:05:24,279 --> 00:05:25,439
But when push comes to shove,

80
00:05:26,120 --> 00:05:27,720
not a single one steps up.

81
00:05:28,839 --> 00:05:29,959
It's the same for everyone.

82
00:05:31,199 --> 00:05:31,720
Here.

83
00:05:48,519 --> 00:05:49,920
I know it sounds harsh,

84
00:05:51,399 --> 00:05:52,560
but it's been a long time.

85
00:05:52,839 --> 00:05:54,360
You really should move on.

86
00:05:56,519 --> 00:05:57,759
It's not that easy.

87
00:06:01,319 --> 00:06:02,959
But you can't keep torturing yourself.

88
00:06:05,120 --> 00:06:07,040
You know I've also had

89
00:06:07,720 --> 00:06:08,639
the same experience.

90
00:06:09,439 --> 00:06:11,000
Actually, I can really

91
00:06:11,439 --> 00:06:12,639
understand how you feel.

92
00:06:13,240 --> 00:06:16,160
I know that feeling makes you...

93
00:06:19,720 --> 00:06:20,240
Su...

94
00:06:20,879 --> 00:06:22,120
Check... check, please.

95
00:06:24,240 --> 00:06:25,040
Stop!

96
00:06:26,600 --> 00:06:27,360
Stop right there!

97
00:06:28,279 --> 00:06:29,680
Fu Yan, I know it's you.

98
00:06:35,480 --> 00:06:37,199
You've been here all along, haven't you?

99
00:06:37,519 --> 00:06:38,319
Su Juan.

100
00:06:41,279 --> 00:06:42,079
Who are you?

101
00:06:45,519 --> 00:06:47,040
Sorry, I need to go home.

102
00:06:47,040 --> 00:06:48,040
I'm not feeling well.

103
00:06:48,040 --> 00:06:48,959
I'll take you home.

104
00:06:49,560 --> 00:06:50,480
I'm fine, thanks.

105
00:06:54,000 --> 00:06:54,800
Su Juan.

106
00:07:04,360 --> 00:07:05,120
Aren't you coming in?

107
00:08:07,519 --> 00:08:08,839
You still kept these.

108
00:08:09,720 --> 00:08:10,519
What did you expect?

109
00:08:12,319 --> 00:08:13,319
Was I supposed to take your things

110
00:08:13,319 --> 00:08:14,519
and throw them all away?

111
00:08:16,800 --> 00:08:17,600
I'm sorry.

112
00:08:20,040 --> 00:08:21,120
Why apologize?

113
00:08:22,560 --> 00:08:24,000
For leaving without a word?

114
00:08:35,360 --> 00:08:36,440
All this time,

115
00:08:37,879 --> 00:08:39,159
where have you been?

116
00:08:40,440 --> 00:08:41,559
I've been wandering.

117
00:08:44,639 --> 00:08:45,879
With nowhere I wanted to go.

118
00:08:52,120 --> 00:08:52,840
So...

119
00:08:53,720 --> 00:08:55,360
You couldn't even give me

120
00:08:55,360 --> 00:08:56,240
a proper reason to leave?

121
00:08:57,240 --> 00:08:58,519
Don't you know?

122
00:09:01,879 --> 00:09:02,679
Like what?

123
00:09:04,320 --> 00:09:05,360
Like...

124
00:09:06,639 --> 00:09:07,759
how I've accomplished nothing.

125
00:09:08,320 --> 00:09:09,759
Knowing there's no hope,

126
00:09:10,639 --> 00:09:11,840
yet still trying to be a writer.

127
00:09:12,519 --> 00:09:14,039
I like what you write.

128
00:09:14,320 --> 00:09:15,600
That's because you like me.

129
00:09:22,440 --> 00:09:23,240
What else?

130
00:09:24,159 --> 00:09:26,759
And my immaturity.

131
00:09:29,279 --> 00:09:30,919
We lived together,

132
00:09:31,879 --> 00:09:32,759
yet I had no idea

133
00:09:32,759 --> 00:09:34,360
what was really bothering you.

134
00:09:36,399 --> 00:09:37,879
With so many reasons,

135
00:09:39,600 --> 00:09:41,039
why not leave for good?

136
00:09:47,120 --> 00:09:48,600
Because I can't let you go.

137
00:10:18,480 --> 00:10:19,279
So,

138
00:10:21,639 --> 00:10:22,600
you still love me?

139
00:10:24,639 --> 00:10:25,200
Yes.

140
00:10:28,840 --> 00:10:29,679
I still love you.

141
00:11:28,440 --> 00:11:29,360
This way, President Sun.

142
00:11:36,200 --> 00:11:38,000
When I was doing the background check,

143
00:11:38,840 --> 00:11:40,759
I found solid evidence.

144
00:11:41,399 --> 00:11:43,080
Your company definitely has issues.

145
00:11:44,080 --> 00:11:44,919
What do you mean?

146
00:11:46,720 --> 00:11:47,879
Are you threatening me?

147
00:11:48,440 --> 00:11:49,399
Just a reminder.

148
00:11:51,000 --> 00:11:52,120
Some problems

149
00:11:52,480 --> 00:11:53,919
need to be handled carefully.

150
00:11:57,639 --> 00:11:58,320
President Sun,

151
00:11:58,759 --> 00:11:59,840
let's get dinner sometime.

152
00:12:01,960 --> 00:12:02,519
This way.

153
00:12:04,679 --> 00:12:05,840
Watch your step.

154
00:12:11,799 --> 00:12:12,559
All right.

155
00:12:13,360 --> 00:12:14,559
Let's leave it at that for now.

156
00:12:15,639 --> 00:12:16,759
We'll talk again later.

157
00:12:17,559 --> 00:12:18,840
I'll definitely bring some good wine.

158
00:12:19,600 --> 00:12:20,480
All right, I'm off.

159
00:12:21,080 --> 00:12:21,720
Goodbye, President Sun.

160
00:12:23,799 --> 00:12:24,480
Sujuan.

161
00:12:24,679 --> 00:12:26,519
President Sun was furious.

162
00:12:26,519 --> 00:12:27,559
What happened between you two?

163
00:12:30,440 --> 00:12:31,200
Su Juan.

164
00:12:31,960 --> 00:12:32,679
Su Juan.

165
00:12:34,440 --> 00:12:35,240
Give her a nudge.

166
00:12:35,480 --> 00:12:37,159
Sujuan. Sujuan.

167
00:12:38,159 --> 00:12:39,120
President Han is calling for you.

168
00:12:45,440 --> 00:12:46,240
Come here.

169
00:12:50,360 --> 00:12:51,159
I'm sorry.

170
00:12:51,759 --> 00:12:53,159
I was too impulsive back there.

171
00:12:55,440 --> 00:12:56,759
He went too far.

172
00:12:57,039 --> 00:12:58,080
It's my fault.

173
00:12:58,759 --> 00:13:00,559
I should have handled it differently.

174
00:13:01,360 --> 00:13:02,519
I'll take responsibility.

175
00:13:02,960 --> 00:13:03,759
What responsibility?

176
00:13:05,799 --> 00:13:08,879
Didn't I ruin the project?

177
00:13:09,559 --> 00:13:10,440
Who said that?

178
00:13:11,360 --> 00:13:12,840
He agreed to work with our company.

179
00:13:14,840 --> 00:13:15,720
A guy like him

180
00:13:15,720 --> 00:13:16,879
always puts profit first.

181
00:13:17,240 --> 00:13:19,360
He decided to work with us long ago.

182
00:13:21,200 --> 00:13:22,559
He just wanted to take advantage of you.

183
00:13:27,639 --> 00:13:28,960
What a jerk.

184
00:13:31,519 --> 00:13:32,559
But he also said

185
00:13:33,320 --> 00:13:34,399
for the follow-up work,

186
00:13:34,399 --> 00:13:35,519
he doesn't want you involved.

187
00:13:37,360 --> 00:13:38,559
And what did you say?

188
00:13:39,679 --> 00:13:40,480
I agreed.

189
00:13:41,639 --> 00:13:42,639
Their company

190
00:13:42,639 --> 00:13:43,720
is our company's most important

191
00:13:43,720 --> 00:13:45,159
partner for the second half of the year.

192
00:13:45,639 --> 00:13:46,879
I didn't get to discuss it with you.

193
00:13:47,559 --> 00:13:48,519
And I didn't want you to have

194
00:13:48,519 --> 00:13:49,559
too much contact with him.

195
00:13:50,279 --> 00:13:51,799
But I'll give you credit for the deal.

196
00:13:54,559 --> 00:13:55,519
Thank you, President Han.

197
00:13:57,799 --> 00:13:58,480
By the way,

198
00:14:01,519 --> 00:14:02,559
last night,

199
00:14:04,159 --> 00:14:05,960
I said some inappropriate things.

200
00:14:07,480 --> 00:14:08,600
Don't take it to heart.

201
00:14:09,440 --> 00:14:10,159
It's fine.

202
00:14:13,879 --> 00:14:14,559
I...

203
00:14:15,120 --> 00:14:16,559
If there's nothing else,

204
00:14:16,639 --> 00:14:18,080
I'll get back to work.

205
00:14:19,159 --> 00:14:20,639
Why are you pushing me away?

206
00:14:23,360 --> 00:14:24,480
You mean...?

207
00:14:25,080 --> 00:14:26,200
You know what I mean.

208
00:14:32,879 --> 00:14:34,039
It's my own problem.

209
00:14:42,360 --> 00:14:44,080
When I came back with coffee just now,

210
00:14:44,080 --> 00:14:45,759
I saw Su Juan hit on the manager again.

211
00:14:46,120 --> 00:14:46,919
Really?

212
00:14:47,240 --> 00:14:48,360
Why would I lie?

213
00:14:48,600 --> 00:14:50,039
I've been watching them for a long time.

214
00:14:50,879 --> 00:14:52,240
And as for President Sun's case,

215
00:14:53,480 --> 00:14:55,159
I don't know what tricks she used,

216
00:14:55,360 --> 00:14:56,399
but she actually landed it.

217
00:14:58,600 --> 00:15:00,200
But Sujuan...

218
00:15:00,200 --> 00:15:01,519
Isn't she already married?

219
00:15:02,120 --> 00:15:03,240
She got dumped a long time ago.

220
00:15:05,399 --> 00:15:07,080
Have you ever heard her mention her husband?

221
00:15:08,159 --> 00:15:09,559
Now that you mention it, no.

222
00:15:10,720 --> 00:15:12,159
Getting dumped at her age...

223
00:15:12,240 --> 00:15:13,879
Isn't that pretty pitiful?

224
00:15:21,000 --> 00:15:21,879
Sujuan.

225
00:15:43,039 --> 00:15:44,440
Miss, your fried rice is ready.

226
00:15:45,080 --> 00:15:45,720
Thank you.

227
00:16:03,240 --> 00:16:04,399
Are you out of your mind?

228
00:16:05,600 --> 00:16:06,679
Are you deaf?

229
00:16:07,240 --> 00:16:07,799
I'm honking!

230
00:16:07,799 --> 00:16:08,840
Can't you hear it?

231
00:16:09,120 --> 00:16:09,720
Yes.

232
00:16:10,360 --> 00:16:11,440
I'm deaf.

233
00:16:11,440 --> 00:16:12,559
I'm crazy.

234
00:16:12,559 --> 00:16:13,679
I can't hear anything.

235
00:16:13,679 --> 00:16:15,480
My ears ring every single day.

236
00:16:15,480 --> 00:16:16,480
I'm losing my mind.

237
00:16:45,879 --> 00:16:47,080
Even if you're leaving,

238
00:16:49,240 --> 00:16:51,080
we should at least have a proper goodbye.

239
00:17:00,679 --> 00:17:02,080
You've made up your mind, is that it?

240
00:17:04,839 --> 00:17:06,400
Do you really want to leave me that badly?

241
00:17:07,640 --> 00:17:08,759
Don't you want me to?

242
00:17:09,559 --> 00:17:10,559
How could I?

243
00:17:11,480 --> 00:17:12,480
Being with me,

244
00:17:13,759 --> 00:17:14,839
are you truly happy?

245
00:17:21,559 --> 00:17:22,119
See?

246
00:17:23,960 --> 00:17:24,920
I was right, wasn't I?

247
00:17:31,680 --> 00:17:33,079
When two people are together,

248
00:17:33,480 --> 00:17:35,079
there will always be some bumps.

249
00:17:35,079 --> 00:17:37,119
That's just an excuse to comfort yourself.

250
00:17:40,400 --> 00:17:41,279
Back then,

251
00:17:43,200 --> 00:17:44,440
you didn't expect it to be like this.

252
00:17:45,400 --> 00:17:46,400
Let's just let each other go.

253
00:17:47,079 --> 00:17:48,319
Let everything start over.

254
00:17:48,480 --> 00:17:49,559
You said it yourself,

255
00:17:50,480 --> 00:17:51,559
you still love me.

256
00:17:53,599 --> 00:17:54,279
I do.

257
00:17:56,440 --> 00:17:58,039
That's why I have to leave you,

258
00:18:01,359 --> 00:18:02,200
Fu Yan.

259
00:18:39,279 --> 00:18:40,079
Let me go!

260
00:18:41,079 --> 00:18:41,839
Help me!

261
00:18:43,559 --> 00:18:44,599
Fu Yan, don't! Let me go!

262
00:18:44,640 --> 00:18:45,759
Help me!

263
00:18:47,279 --> 00:18:48,480
Help me! Help!

264
00:18:49,720 --> 00:18:52,559
Help... Help me!
